{"id":761,"slug":"sword-of-the-beast","title":"Sword of the Beast","year":1965,"country":"Japan","duration":85,"spine":311,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/761-sword-of-the-beast","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/04e10116294528ec2da38cb6c0a5b044/3pKnBkuWZlWe0VWIvtR6D92XRuWPU2_large.jpg","description":"Legendary swordplay filmmaker Hideo Gosha's _Sword of the Beast_ chronicles the flight of the low-level swordsman Gennosuke, who kills one of his ministers as part of a reform plot. His former comrades then turn on him, and this betrayal so shakes his sense of honor that he decides to live in the wild, like an animal. There he joins up with a motley group who are illegally mining the shogun’s gold, and, with the aid of another swordsman, gets a chance not just at survival but to recover his name and honor. ","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Hideo Gosha","slug":"hideo-gosha"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Mikijiro Hira","role":"Gennosuke Yuki","slug":"mikijiro-hira"},{"actor":"Go Kato","role":"Jurota Yamane","slug":"go-kato"},{"actor":"Shima Iwashita","role":"Taka","slug":"shima-iwashita"},{"actor":"Eijiro Tono","role":"Counselor of Jurota’s clan","slug":"eijiro-tono"},{"actor":"Shigeru Amachi","role":"Vice-counselor of Gennosuke’s clan","slug":"shigeru-amachi"},{"actor":"Kunie Tanaka","role":"Tanji","slug":"kunie-tanaka"},{"actor":"Toshie Kimura","role":"Misa","slug":"toshie-kimura"},{"actor":"Kantaro Suga","role":"Daizaburo","slug":"kantaro-suga"},{"actor":"Takeshi Kato","role":"Gundayu","slug":"takeshi-kato"},{"actor":"Yoko Mihara","role":"Osen","slug":"yoko-mihara"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Hideo Gosha","slug":"hideo-gosha"},{"role":"Screenplay","person":"Hideo Gosha","slug":"hideo-gosha"},{"role":"Screenplay","person":"Eizaburo Shiba","slug":null},{"role":"Cinematography","person":"Toshitada Tsuchiya","slug":null},{"role":"Art direction","person":"Mamoru Abe","slug":null}],"pickedBy":[],"related":[655,529,753],"set